      "body": "Dividend of ₹2.00 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 13th February 2026 Payment date: 11th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 4.5%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.4%. Sustainability & Growth The dividend has increased by an average of 12% per year over the past 6 years and payments have been stable during that time.",
